<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS3" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ Magnifying What Matters: Attention-Guided Adaptive Rendering for Visual Text Comprehension" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.3 </span>Composing AGAR with Post-Training</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ Magnifying What Matters: Attention-Guided Adaptive Rendering for Visual Text Comprehension" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Robustness to Imperfect Inputs</span></a>
